# Save the profile photo. Start the API with Aspire first.
@host = http://localhost:5279
@accessToken = paste-an-access-token

### A Base64 JPEG → 204. This one is the smallest valid start of a JPEG; use a real one to see it in the app.
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/users/me/photo
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image": "/9j/4AAQSkZJRgABAQ=="
}

### Not a Base64 JPEG → 400, the errors name the field.
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/users/me/photo
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image": "not-a-photo"
}
